# Uses 'Entry' (or 'Signal') from your TradingView CSV to locate entries.
# Computes entry-time features: Fractal Dimension (FD), price height vs rolling ranges,
# ATR context, EMA distances, gaps, weekday/month timing. Skips RVOL if volume absent.

